-     * have no more grapheme clusters than the specified limit. An ellipsis
-     * sequence (by default {@code "..."}) is used to designate whether the
-     * limit was reached. Use {@link #ellipsis(CharSequence)} to set a custom
-     * ellipsis sequence.
